It bundles no third-party source code, but it depends on open-source
packages at runtime and at build time. Those packages remain under their
own licenses, held by their respective authors. The complete inventory,
with version and license for each declared dependency, is in
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.

Ermes Knowledge can optionally send retrieved passages to a local Ollama
instance or to an approved cloud provider. Those services are operated by
third parties under their own terms; this project neither includes nor
redistributes them, and no data reaches them unless an administrator
explicitly enables that mode for a specific library.

The demo corpora under examples/ describe fictional companies. Any
resemblance to real organisations, documents or people is unintended.

The historical WinSarp formula engine the project started from was removed
from the repository on 18 September 2026; it is preserved only in Git
history and is not part of this distribution.
